Gerald works at a daycare where he gets $30 a day. He worked all week and spent a hundred bucks. How much does he have left?,Gerald works at a daycare that pays him $30 every day. He worked for an entire week and spent a total of $100. How much does he have left?,110,110,50,110,"Step 1: Determine how many days Gerald worked in a week.  
